miştir.</p><section><h2>Şeyhülislam İbn Teymiyye</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">أي وبانيها<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/550</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ولفظ &quot; ما &quot; يدل على الصفة بخلاف &quot; من &quot;. فإنه يدل على العين<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/550</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=tr#s91a5\">Etkileşimli tefsirde aç (tam metinler)</a><div class=\"pn\"><span></span><a href=\"/tr/ayah/91-7.html\">Sonraki âyet (91:7)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tefsîru&#x27;ş-Şeyhayn · <a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Proje hakkında</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Gizlilik ve şartlar</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/91-7.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"tr\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tefsiri: Ash-Shams 91:7 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Nefse ve ona bir düzen içinde biçim verene.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/91-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/91-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/91-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/91-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/91-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/91-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/91-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/91-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafs